arget="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://hachyderm.io/@kevinrenskers/114308702275578978&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;其它类似工具有 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1405" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;RSS-lambda&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1279" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Feed Filter Maker&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/223" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;siftRSS&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/716" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Grepfeed&lt;/a&gt; 等&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/TDCOdKQqM3MD0Rb5pGfKKf4h0bVNp33Uxfqa-h5f-Drjfbx0wNAPJM5BuxkbnCHad_3NcwZDt_r4HzJQZ1NXe-UMp9eE7yk5_sJTxmb9KttKfvU0U29iw9I5mUEFcu-5hH8ywKCy6gBpEpNLqHtWzxDvOc97qO-jffWWNYmIv7LvIhMl4Q_-27NZZnzkzsZiYhiOl5BpQDNbU29kOIgEpNj7XRDnGB71fSxPpn7K02ZTWxN-nbZLPhTUyHRnkSYuPE1W6QFR2HOldC6M1OWVvKBjzYdLPVNszQj9ErDX3XnZWl5PvNWeFIAecg1HotGbooGMJ5n4ZKgZDzrXez0rMA.jpg" width="800" height="252" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</guid><pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 00:59:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;五年前的今天，我提交了「&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/536" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;ALL-about-RSS&lt;/a&gt;」的第一条 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/commit/fbb01c3fa2279df9048f23d6cd52e7b04b9daa1c" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;commit&lt;/a&gt;，以彰显 RSS 作为开放规范的多样性和生命力。五年后，该 List 承蒙大家托举，成长为了一个 RSS 玩家的乐土，有开发者来 PR 自己的 RSS 相关作品，有爱好者来纠错补缺，也有&lt;a href="https://rss.tips/#donators" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;捐赠&lt;/a&gt;、加星、关注等各种形式的支持与助力。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://star-history.com/#aboutrss/all-about-rss&amp;amp;Date" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;5K+ &lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⭐️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/forks" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;200+ forks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/aboutrss/all-about-rss/graphs/contributors" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;40+ 位贡献者&lt;/a&gt;，已使 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/pulls" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;PR 序号来到 #100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢各位 RSS 玩家，也欢迎继续群策群力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/Hm0DP1qshsaQOVJCcGaFUJuR2ukF5fYqenm-s7VwJ7Fha_EUvRgcfOQfHL6BszXAk981kSkro8ZOyUSXpFryaTzTckako_SWdGznDuMQBkqAB5pVYTnQaNEomOKI3FE9TYVZrb_qiaE7PgdyycAZC45sEFHfsIeUH-_63O2rk6fNSuoZMVeIZhxVRNPvzM3KMLM-wolZ3WY8g233Qyo8JO3cRmrTIcOzUYKqEUGetyxXz1n9AK267xhwfaSOurdLpGwaO8TvCbToLgW3Cr7FOwgn-xsUGJACwo_UmOEczmJ_e3kGQGHOqC3geXgAvfv4-O8TCAMGaCOCwhdPPc278w.jpg" width="800" height="460" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 01:01:16 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;该 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1511?q=%23Android"&gt;#Android&lt;/a&gt; App 免费，主打长毛象客户端，但也支持订阅 RSS 和 Bluesky，意味着可以构建多渠道的混合 Feed 流。上线于 24 年夏天。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;官网：&lt;a href="https://fread.xyz/" target="_blan