&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 的这个能长久存活：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/VUlXJmm_kohHdYXrVwTU8u0apnf1g8pG_TG9yOOlhHyCcbC6qWXL7Nl9buTazetA2wt9hlMAK85R9vEP7r96Np8-JL7-L5zVxkNawsgyjj9z3OHdmX0pkHA-PAVmbG0k7rLBODJxCI71sSjzEaBbAbfynY19wlGMFLQTuuS3jEECothWrF2kNPRnmwzXJHqn4rifdWJ_LkB4w2YygVNkUjIT6UgBdFTAXLEZovjD9KYJUc1F835MIvW5aCaSseu0UlHHWqqruKLNMipLmOcL-rMdI_66rTcIyPR455coW6sWEqhZUXrrqt_OflZaRqAGm2edjlYk5G9bnjh_nKqmEg.jpg" width="552" height="239" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 12:02:52 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>